sequenceDiagram
    participant PX as agent/price.mjs
    participant OR as NVDAPriceOracle
    participant GW as Circle Gateway
    participant S as x402 price sellers
    participant G as The Graph
    participant H as TrancheJITHook

    PX->>OR: getPrice() + maxStaleness()
    alt fresh — below 80% of maxStaleness — or market closed
        PX-->>PX: skip — no gas, no payment
    else stale and market open
        PX->>S: GET NVDA quote — x402
        S-->>PX: 402 payment required
        PX->>GW: Gateway batched nanopayment — chain from seller accepts
        GW-->>S: settlement
        S-->>PX: quote + paymentRef
        PX->>PX: map US/Eastern session to marketStatus
        PX->>OR: updatePrice(mid, marketStatus, sourceTimestamp, paymentRef)
        Note over OR: only the seeded writer — the agent operator — is accepted
        OR-->>G: PriceUpdated indexed into OracleState / PriceUpdates
        OR-->>H: getPrice().valid gates swaps — freshness + open market
    end
    Note over PX,S: sellers are tried in order · only Circle Gateway batched settlement is accepted · manual override ORACLE_PRICE_USD skips the network · ORACLE_PRICE_FALLBACK_URL is an explicit opt-in
